421	 
422	 ## Politeness
423	 
424	 Poll no faster than every five seconds; the socket exists so you need not, and a widget is one reader on one machine, never one per viewer. Keep the token out of anything you publish: whoever has it can watch, and a widget pasted into a shared overlay carries it. If it gets out, **Stop sharing** and share again; the old token is dead the moment you do. Nothing here writes to the run except an ask, and an ask only asks.
